    ],
    "text": "[A1][/A1]NAME",
    "placeholders": {
     "A1": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_04_01\" id=\"tag_17_04_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     13
    ],
    "text": "abort — generate an abnormal process abort",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_04_02\" id=\"tag_17_04_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/stdlib.h.html\">stdlib.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\n_Noreturn void abort(void);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_04_03\" id=\"tag_17_04_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]abort[/I5]() function shall cause abnormal process termination to occur, unless a SIGABRT signal that it generates is\ncaught and the signal handler does not return.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "[S6][[A7]CX[/A7]][/S6] [IMG8] The\nabnormal termination processing shall include the default actions defined for SIGABRT and may include an attempt to effect [A9][I10]fclose[/I10]()[/A9] on all open streams. [IMG11]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S6": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A7": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG8": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "A9": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/fclose.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG11": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The SIGABRT signal shall be sent to the calling [S12][[A13]CX[/A13]][/S12] [IMG14] &nbsp;thread [IMG15] &nbsp;as if by means of [A16][I17]raise[/I17]()[/A16] with the argument SIGABRT. [S18][[A19]CX[/A19]][/S18] [IMG20] If this signal does\nnot terminate the process (for example, if the signal is caught and the handler returns), [I21]abort[/I21]() may change the disposition\nof SIGABRT to SIG_DFL and send the signal (in the same way) again. If a second signal is sent and it does not terminate the\nprocess, the behavior is unspecified, except that the [I22]abort[/I22]() call shall not return. [IMG23]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S12": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A13": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG14": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "IMG15": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "A16": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/raise.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I17": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S18": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A19": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG20": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I21": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG23": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "[S24][[A25]CX[/A25]][/S24] [IMG26] The\nstatus made available to [A27][I28]wait[/I28]()[/A27], [A29][I30]waitid[/I30]()[/A29], or [A31][I32]waitpid[/I32]()[/A31] by [I33]abort[/I33]() shall\nbe that of a process terminated by the SIGABRT signal. [IMG34] The\n[I35]abort[/I35]() function shall override blocking or ignoring the SIGABRT signal.",
    "placeholders": {
     "S24": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A25": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG26": {
      "open": "",
