    "text": "IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;1003.1-2001/Cor&nbsp;1-2002, item XSH/TC1/D6/10 is applied, changing the DESCRIPTION of abnormal termination\nprocessing and adding to the RATIONALE section.",
    "placeholders": {},
